### Virgil — REMOVED, NOT SHIPPED

The Excalidraw repository ships the **Virgil** hand-drawn font. No licence file
for Virgil is present anywhere in the upstream repository, so its redistribution
terms are unknown.

**Firo does not ship Virgil and must not.** See
[`docs/adr/0013-replace-the-virgil-font.md`](docs/adr/0013-replace-the-virgil-font.md).
The default hand-drawn face is a documented, explicitly-licensed substitute.

